# Send campaign and CRM-sequence email through the platform ESP (Resend)
# when a business has no connected Gmail account, or its token has expired.
# Unset means ON. Set to off/false/0 to send nothing instead.
#
# The trade: mail then leaves the PLATFORM's domain, not the merchant's, so
# SPF/DKIM are ours and recipients see our sending domain. It is a fallback
# for people who have not connected an account, not a replacement for doing so.
MARKETING_ESP_FALLBACK=

# TTD per USD, the anchor the whole FX table is derived from.
# frankfurter.app (ECB data) does not quote TTD, JMD, BBD, XCD or GYD, so
# the live majors are crossed through USD against this number. TTD is a
# managed rate rather than a free float, so it moves rarely — but it is a
# number a human maintains, and this exists so a move can be corrected
# without a deploy. Unset uses the built-in baseline (6.78).
TTD_PER_USD=
